This product adapts the role prompts, transport tokens, memory-commit
pipeline, and Phase 1 / Phase 2 lineage protocol of RSIAgent
(https://github.com/AetherLabsAI/RSIAgent), Copyright 2026 RSIAgent
contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  Sibo Zhu, Shicheng Fan, Xinyue Wang, Wenyi Wu, Kun Zhou, Biwei Huang.
  "RSIAgent: Autonomous Exploration for Recursive Self-improvement in New
  Environments." arXiv:2609.15364, 2026.

The prompts were rewritten for a tool-using coding harness; the adapted
sources are src/roles/*.ts, src/protocol/*.ts, src/memory/hash.ts and
src/engine/lineage.ts. No RSIAgent benchmark, VM, or evaluator code is
included.

DeepSeek Harness (https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) is
MIT-licensed; this package depends on its published npm packages and does
not redistribute them.
